      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flanagan%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Just north of the village center, the Flanagan Co‑op hosts several grain elevators and silos at Main and Lumber streets.",
